<title>NEW ZEALAND: Societe Generale has 12.9 pct of Evergreen.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale has 12.9 pct of Evergreen.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Asset Management Corporation became a substantial security holder in Evergreen Forests Limited on March 13, with a relevant interest in 12.9 percent of its voting securities, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It did not say what their stake had been before, but shareholdings become notifiable above 5.0 percent in New Zealand.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
